 금오톡톡 안내 메시지가 발송되었습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">수강 중인 교과목 중 결석시간이 전체 수업시간의&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">1/4</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">을 초과하는 경우</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">출석미달&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">과목별 수업시간 수의&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">분의&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">3&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">미만 출석</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">로&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">F</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학점 처리예정과목이며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">,&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">전체수업시간&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">1/4</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">의&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">50%&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이상 결석하는 경우</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">전체 수업시간의&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">1/8</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">인 과목의 경우 출석미달 주의과목입니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">출석미달교과목현황조회 경로:</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold;\">원스톱서비스&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">–&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold;\">학사관리</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold;\">수강신청</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold;\">개인별강의시간표 조회 하단 출석미달</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold;\">주의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold;\">교과목 현황</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">유의사항</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">전자출결에서 출결상황이 미입력된 과목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">미출결 상태</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">은 출석미달교과목 현황에서 조회되지 않아</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold;\">출석미달</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold;\">주의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold;\">대상자에서 누락될 수 있으므로</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold;\">전자출결 앱에서 본인의 출결상황을 반드시 확인하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">- LMS&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">동영상 강의 및 실시간 온라인 강의의 출결정보는 반영시기가 유동적일 수 있으며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold;\">이에 따라 출석미달</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold;\">주의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold;\">대상이 아님에도 안내메세지가 발송될 수 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">-조기취업자의 경우 출석인정승인을 받아도 공결과 달리 자동으로 출석인정처리가 되지 않으므로, 해당부분&nbsp; 과목담당교수님께 출석처리 여부를 반드시 확인하시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">출결에 오류가 있을 시&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(